+			//   frame on|off          the 16-sample DSP frame clock
+			//   iclock                clear CLOCK RECEIVE (run off the internal clock)
+			//   seq BANK,PAT          seqSelectLive -- select a bank and pattern
+			//   transport             startTransportLive
+			//   triglog               installTrigLog (then `trigs` prints it)
+			//   trigs                 print the per-track live-nibble trig log
+			//   coverage              every PC from HERE on -> --coverage FILE
+			//   frames N [A,L=HEX]    run N more frames, or stop early once L bytes
+			//                         at A equal HEX -- a bind phase with a ceiling
+			//
+			// ADDR/ARG/VALUE is HEX, NAME, NAME+HEX or NAME-HEX.  Every line
